+
\partial_\nu F_{\tau\sigma}
+
\partial_\tau F_{\sigma\nu}
=0
}.$ 这三项循环地分配导数指标和两个场张量指标。这常缩写为 $\partial_{[\sigma}F_{\nu\tau]}=0,$ 其中方括号表示反对称化。

p.src:
Choose, for example, $(\sigma,\nu,\tau)=(y,x,0).$ Then Equation [eq:bianchi] combines two spatial derivatives of electric components with a time derivative of a magnetic component: $\partial_yF_{x0}
+
\partial_xF_{0y}
+
\partial_0F_{yx}
=0.$ Using the matrix in Equation [eq:f-lower-matrix], this is one component of $\boldsymbol\nabla\times\mathbf E
-\frac{\partial\mathbf B}{\partial t}
=\mathbf0,$ with the relative signs fixed by antisymmetry. Choosing the other pairs of spatial indices supplies the other two curl components.

